(vector (map (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "cloud-itonami-iso3166-{deu,gbr} :implemented" "contacts.edn expansion to country blueprints" "cloud-itonami-iso3166-{grc,alb,bih,aze,cub,dom} blueprint scope")), (:adr/topic "cloud-itonami-iso3166-wave-deu-gbr-contacts-batch27"), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607105900-cloud-itonami-iso3166-wave-deu-gbr-contacts-batch27"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/body "# ADR-2607105900: iso3166 wave — DEU/GBR :implemented, contacts expansion, batch 27\n\n**Status**: accepted\n**Date**: 2026-07-10\n\n## Decision\n\n1. **:implemented** — promote DEU and GBR marketentry actors (local-rep /\n   ust-idnr and uk-entity / vat flagship HARD checks; 24 tests each).\n2. **Contacts expansion** — grow `contacts.edn` to cover all country\n   blueprints + agencies (~120 entries) with HQ/address from ooyake;\n   fill USA-EPA/SEC/FCC HQ; write `organization.edn` across blueprints.\n3. **Country batch 27** — GRC, ALB, BIH, AZE, CUB, DOM → :blueprint.\n\n## Registry\n\n- total 227 · implemented 5 · blueprint 121 · spec 101"), (:adr/deciders (vector "Jun Kawasaki")), (:adr/date "2026-07-10"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/decision-summary "{:implemented [\"DEU\" \"GBR\"], :contacts ~120, :batch27 [\"GRC\" \"ALB\" \"BIH\" \"AZE\" \"CUB\" \"DOM\"], :maturity {:implemented 5 :blueprint 121 :spec 101 :total 227}}"), (:adr/title "ADR-2607105900: iso3166 wave — DEU/GBR :implemented, contacts expansion, batch 27"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))